er to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. October to November is also the driest pair, with a normal of 4.99 inches. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 20% of normal in September to October. So far in 2026, May to June ran 198% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value.</p>"}
